⏺ Created CLAUDE.md at the worktree root. It covers:

  - Commands for build, test (whole suite, one module, one test), strict clippy,
    docs, examples, and the ssh feature, plus the lint policy and
    test-parallelism caveats.
  - Architecture as it stands today: the wide View trait and its dangerous
    defaults, has-a containers with selective forwarding and no late binding,
    the Cluster/ListViewer/Editor base-with-data trait idiom, the pushed-down
    palette chain in place of an owner pointer, three-phase event dispatch, the
    duplicated modal loops and the "commands below 1000 close the dialog" rule,
    SF_CLOSED window lifecycle, SharedX newtypes, command numbering and the
    global command set, and the terminal backend layer.
  - Pending design work pointing at docs/MISSING-INHERITANCE.md so future
    sessions do not fight the planned 3.0.0 direction.
  - Conventions: copyright headers, commit prefixes, quitting TUI apps with
    Alt-X before closing the terminal.

